-- `foreign_arity_mismatch` (boundary.md §4, check 4, as amended 2026-10-02):
-- a sibling may leave out a TRAILING run of `()` parameters, and only that.
-- `say`'s `()` comes before a written parameter, so the one-parameter export
-- would receive the `null` where the string belongs.
pub foreign type Program


pub foreign pure say : (), String → Program
